trait-wf-deaf-name = Deaf
trait-wf-deaf-desc = You are incurably deaf. You hear no sound and no radio, and catch only some of what is said near you.

trait-wf-pseudobulbar-affect-name = Pseudobulbar Affect
trait-wf-pseudobulbar-affect-desc = Now and then you burst out laughing and can't stop it.

trait-wf-illuminated-name = Illuminated
trait-wf-illuminated-desc = You give off a soft glow. It won't replace a flashlight.

trait-wf-fragility-name = Fragility
trait-wf-fragility-desc = Bruises and burns hurt you more than most. You take 25% more blunt and heat damage.

trait-wf-rad-fiend-name = Rad Fiend
trait-wf-rad-fiend-desc = Radiation does you no harm.

trait-wf-hardened-soles-name = Hardened Soles
trait-wf-hardened-soles-desc = You're used to going barefoot. Glass shards and other floor hazards don't hurt you.

trait-wf-canine-traits-name = Canine Traits
trait-wf-canine-traits-desc = You act like a dog and bark now and then when you talk.

trait-wf-avian-traits-name = Avian Traits
trait-wf-avian-traits-desc = You act like a bird and squawk now and then when you talk.
